# ===== Unreal Engine =====
# Auto-generated / build output — never commit these
**/Binaries/
**/Build/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Intermediate/
**/Saved/
**/.vs/
**/Content/**/*_BuiltData.uasset

# Visual Studio / Rider
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.sdf
*.sln
*.suo
.idea/
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Our docs/build guide folder collides with UE's Build/ ignore above (Windows is case-insensitive) — keep it tracked
!docs/build/
!docs/build/**

# ===== What we DO commit =====
# .uproject, Config/, Content/ (assets), Source/ (C++), and everything under docs/
